  "question": "System Description:\nThis is an information management platform used by M Group to effectively manage the employees of its subsidiaries, meeting the company’s various business management needs.\nBusiness Requirements Description:\n1.Subsidiary Management:\nThe system records information about each subsidiary, including subsidiary ID, name, manager ID, contact address, and phone number. Each subsidiary has a unique subsidiary ID, one manager, and multiple business departments.\n2.Business Department Management:\nThe system records information about each business department, including department ID, name, address, phone number, and affiliated subsidiary ID. Each business department has a unique department ID, one supervisor, and multiple employees.\n3.Employee Management:\nThe system records information about each employee, including employee ID, name, position, affiliated department ID, phone number, family member names, and relationships. Each employee has a unique employee ID and belongs to only one department.\n4.Identity Verification:\nUsers must undergo identity verification before logging into the system.\n5.Real Estate Information Management:\nReal estate agents can log into the system and enter information about the properties they are responsible for selling. However, this information must be approved by the system administrator.\n6.Real Estate Information Export:\nSystem administrators can export a list of all real estate information. They will periodically summarize and update the list, removing properties that are no longer for sale.",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0479\nCREATE TABLE `subsidiary` (\n  `subsidiary_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `subsidiary_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `manager_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `contact_address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`subsidiary_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `business_department` (\n  `department_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `department_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `subsidiary_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `supervisor_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`department_id`),\n  KEY `business_department_ibfk_1` (`subsidiary_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `business_department_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`subsidiary_id`) REFERENCES `subsidiary` (`subsidiary_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `employee` (\n  `employee_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `employee_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `position` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `department_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(20) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `family_member_names` varchar(500) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `relationships` varchar(500) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`employee_id`),\n  KEY `employee_ibfk_1` (`department_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `employee_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`department_id`) REFERENCES `business_department` (`department_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `user_account` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `username` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `password_hash` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `role` varchar(50) NOT NULL,\n  `employee_id` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `identity_verified` tinyint(1) NOT NULL DEFAULT '0',\n  `verified_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`),\n  UNIQUE KEY `username` (`username`),\n  KEY `user_account_ibfk_1` (`employee_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `user_account_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`employee_id`) REFERENCES `employee` (`employee_id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `real_estate_property` (\n  `property_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `agent_user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `property_name` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `property_address` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `price` decimal(12,2) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `description` text,\n  `status` varchar(50) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'pending_approval',\n  `approved_by` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `approved_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  `created_at` datetime NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,\n  `updated_at` datetime DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`property_id`),\n  KEY `real_estate_property_ibfk_1` (`agent_user_id`),\n  KEY `real_estate_property_ibfk_2` (`approved_by`),\n  CONSTRAINT `real_estate_property_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`agent_user_id`) REFERENCES `user_account` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `real_estate_property_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`approved_by`) REFERENCES `user_account` (`user_id`) ON DELETE SET NULL ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
